-- (a) A claim fraudulent in any respect, or fraudulent means or devices used by the Insured or
-- its representative to obtain a benefit: ALL benefits under the policy are forfeited.
@ref General Condition 4(a) (src:284-286)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`why General Condition 4(a) forfeits the benefits` l MEANS
    concat (LIST (`reason unless` (NOT l's `the Insured's conduct`'s `the claim is fraudulent in some respect`)
                                  "General Condition 4(a): the claim is fraudulent in some respect")
               , (`reason unless` (NOT l's `the Insured's conduct`'s `fraudulent means or devices were used to obtain a benefit`)
                                  "General Condition 4(a): fraudulent means or devices were used to obtain a benefit"))

-- (b) A claim the Insurer rejected, with no proceedings commenced within three months of the
-- rejection or, where there was an arbitration under General Condition 7, within three months of
-- the award. Fork F29: calendar months, to the same date three months on (`add months`, which
-- falls back to the month's last day where that date does not exist).
@ref General Condition 4(b) (src:287-290)
GIVEN `the day the three months start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day to commence proceedings, three months from` `the day the three months start` MEANS
    `add months` `the day the three months start` 3

@ref General Condition 4(b) (src:287-290)
GIVEN `the day the three months start`        IS A DATE
      `the day proceedings were commenced`    IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the day the question is asked`         IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 4(b) has forfeited the benefits` `the day the three months start` `the day proceedings were commenced` `the day the question is asked` MEANS
        `the day the question is asked` GREATER THAN `the last day`
    AND CONSIDER `the day proceedings were commenced`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST c  THEN c GREATER THAN `the last day`
    WHERE
        `the last day` MEANS `the last day to commence proceedings, three months from` `the day the three months start`

§§ `General Condition 5: subrogation`

-- Whoever claims must, at the Insurer's expense, do, concur in and permit every act the Insurer
-- reasonably requires to preserve and enforce rights against third parties, before or after
-- payment. A condition precedent. LAW: art 54(3) (aid line 1043-1049) bars the insurer from
-- recovering from the insured's parents, spouse or children unless they caused the loss
-- intentionally; the document is silent, and this encoding does not model who the third party is.
-- src:291 | 5. THẾ QUYỀN ĐÒI BỒI THƯỜNG
-- src:292 | Người có quyền khiếu nại đòi bồi thường theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm này, bằng chi phí của Bảo Minh,
-- src:293 | thực hiện, hỗ trợ thực hiện và cho phép thực hiện mọi hành động cần thiết và hợp lý theo yêu cầu
-- src:294 | của Bảo Minh nhằm bảo lưu các quyền, các biện pháp khôi phục, giảm nhẹ tổn thất bằng việc đòi
-- src:295 | các bên thứ ba khác, là các quyền mà Bảo Minh được hưởng hoặc được thế quyền sau khi đã chi trả
-- src:296 | cho Người được bảo hiểm theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm này, dù cho các việc như vậy có thể phải được
-- src:297 | thực hiện trước hoặc sau khi Bảo Minh đã chi trả bồi thường.
@ref General Condition 5 (src:291-297)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`why General Condition 5 is not met` l MEANS
    `reason unless` (NOT l's `the Insured's conduct`'s `refused an act the Insurer required to enforce its rights against others`)
                    "General Condition 5: the Insured refused an act the Insurer required against third parties"

