-- src:299 | Nếu tại thời điểm xảy ra tổn thất hoặc tổn hại cho tài sản được bảo hiểm theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm

§§ `General Condition 7: arbitration`

-- Only the AMOUNT of a claim goes to arbitration, independently of any other question. A sole
-- arbitrator named in writing by both parties; then, if either party disagrees with that
-- arbitrator's decision, each appoints another arbitrator in writing "sau 2 tháng" (AFTER two
-- months) from receiving the other's written request; a party who fails to appoint "trong vòng 2
-- tháng" (WITHIN two months) of the other's written notice lets the other appoint a sole
-- arbitrator. Fork F21: both periods run from receipt of the same request, both edges are
-- inclusive, and the window is therefore the single day two months after receipt (Finding 3).
