--
-- CLOCK for this rule only: MONTHS from the day the party received the other's written request.
@ref General Condition 7 (src:310-314)
GIVEN `the party who received the request` IS A `A party`
      `the other party`                     IS A `A party`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`General Condition 7: appointing the second arbitrator` `the party who received the request` `the other party` MEANS
    PARTY `the party who received the request`
    MUST  `appoint an arbitrator in writing`
    AFTER 2 WITHIN 2 OF THE ARMING
    HENCE FULFILLED
